  "decision_date": "09/06/2016",
  "description": "Alterations to form one two-bedroom flat at lower ground floor, retention of two upper floor flats, reduction in scale of the outbuilding to previously approved side, use of rear outbuilding ancillary to the flats, installation of a bike storage, recycling area and associated landscaping.",
  "site_name": "96 LONDON TW8",
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "09/06/2016",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": null,
  "street_name": "Windmill Road",
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Minor dwellings",
  "lapsed_date": "09/06/2019",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (02, 03, 1a Received: 15 April 2016 01 Received: 09 June 2016) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 4 - The outbuilding hereby permitted shall not be occupied at any time other than for purposes ancillary to the residential use of the dwelling known as [Flat 3, 96 Windmill Road, Brentford TW8 9NA].",
    "Condition : 5 - The window formed in the side elevation of the outbuilding shall be obscure glazed fixed shut and shall not be repaired or replaced otherwise than with obscured glazing.",
    "Condition : 6 - No additional windows or other glazed openings shall be formed in the  side walls of the outbuilding hereby approved and no additional doors inserted in the building without the prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.\r\n",
    "Condition : 7 - No development shall take place until details of the proposed cycle parking stores and have been submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 8 - Before the development hereby permitted is occupied, arrangements shall be agreed in writing with the local planning authority and be put in place to ensure that, with the exception of disabled persons, no resident of the development shall obtain a resident's parking permit within any controlled parking zone which may be in force in the surrounding area at any time."
  ],
